{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_3d836395ed84dd13","item_id":"slot_3d836395ed84dd13#1","text":"我们聊一下标箔的情况。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"我们聊一下标箔的情况。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_def1bda3ab32e6e8","item_id":"slot_def1bda3ab32e6e8#1","text":"首先，标箔跟锂电在后端处理上，标箔会有一些设备需求，也请您帮我们做一个价值量的大致拆分。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"首先，标箔跟锂电在后端处理上，标箔会有一些设备需求，也请您帮我们做一个价值量的大致拆分。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_387a520a9b4de021","item_id":"slot_387a520a9b4de021#1","text":"标箔的生产设备——生箔机，往前基本和锂电大致一样。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"标箔的生产设备——生箔机，往前基本和锂电大致一样。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_011e2d6ba749d584","item_id":"slot_011e2d6ba749d584#1","text":"后端的配套，","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"other","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"unknown","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"后端的配套，","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_ffcbbdd7bfa88067","item_id":"slot_ffcbbdd7bfa88067#1","text":"因为传统标箔的线速度会高一点。","semantic_type":"evidence","statement_role":"evidence","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"因为传统标箔的线速度会高一点。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_0d888afc2930623c","item_id":"slot_0d888afc2930623c#1","text":"HTE和低阶RTF的高温高延展铜箔，线速度低一些，大概是6台生箔机配套1台表面处理机。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"比如HTE和低阶RTF的高温高延展铜箔，线速度低一些，大概是6台生箔机配套1台表面处理机。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_0d888afc2930623c","item_id":"slot_0d888afc2930623c#2","text":"如果要做高阶的RTF和HVLP的低阶甚至更高阶产品，处理机的数量可能会增加到3到4台生箔机对应1台表面处理机。","semantic_type":"forecast","statement_role":"condition","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_quote":"如果要做高阶的RTF和HVLP的低阶甚至更高阶产品，处理机的数量可能会增加到3到4台生箔机对应1台表面处理机。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_4070c5c3458546ec","item_id":"slot_4070c5c3458546ec#1","text":"这样处理机的量就上来了。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"这样处理机的量就上来了。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_b5c81a9087d086d1","item_id":"slot_b5c81a9087d086d1#1","text":"传统标准HTE的处理机大概600到700万一台，现在HVLP的超过1000万一台，大概就是这个价格。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"传统标准HTE的处理机大概600到700万一台，现在HVLP的超过1000万一台，大概就是这个价格。","unknown_fields":[]}
