{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_c0126fa9d896fee3","item_id":"slot_c0126fa9d896fee3#1","text":"每万吨的产值24套，应该对应4台表处理。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"每万吨的产值24套，应该对应4台表处理。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_9487b3731b0153b4","item_id":"slot_9487b3731b0153b4#1","text":"如果做HTE，就至少要2400万到2800万每万吨，对吧？","semantic_type":"question","statement_role":"condition","speech_role":"question","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"unknown","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"unknown","evidence_quote":"如果做HTE，就至少要2400万到2800万每万吨，对吧？","unknown_fields":[]}
