{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_7ea1d2d12d3bb606","item_id":"slot_7ea1d2d12d3bb606#1","text":"主持人：OK，那表处理带来的增量很明显，而且有一个用量通胀的逻辑——越往高阶的电子箔走，消耗量越大。","semantic_type":"opinion","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_910a36a47b06","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"主持人：OK，那表处理带来的增量很明显，而且有一个用量通胀的逻辑——越往高阶的电子箔走，消耗量越大。","unknown_fields":[]}
